{"3710610": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "DETRA", "steam_appid": 3710610, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Vir and Druxy. Druxy and Vir. Vir would do anything for the woman that he loved. And Druxy knew that.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vir and Druxy go on an expedition to explore an abandoned laboratory, in search for a cure to treat a mystery illness that Druxy has come down with. It becomes Vir’s responsibility to explore the eerie floors of the building and complete his goal of saving the one that he loves. Little does he know, Druxy has another plan up her sleeve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Compelling storytelling and characters:</strong></i> The story of DETRA spans four in-game days, with intriguing twists and turns.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Stealth mechanics and difficulty:</strong></i> Switch between first-person and third-person cameras as you avoid glaring security cameras, explore the four different levels and complete your mission to save Druxy.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Atmospheric graphics:</strong></i> Enjoy a dark 3D atmosphere and beautiful 2D graphics.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CONTROLS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The controls can be changed in the game, but these are the defaults.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Movement: WASD</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact: E</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run: Left Shift</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sneak: Ctrl</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Camera Swap: G</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >– </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Default FOV: 90</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Default sens: 2</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Vir and Druxy. Druxy and Vir. Vir would do anything for the woman that he loved. And Druxy knew that.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vir and Druxy go on an expedition to explore an abandoned laboratory, in search for a cure to treat a mystery illness that Druxy has come down with. It becomes Vir’s responsibility to explore the eerie floors of the building and complete his goal of saving the one that he loves. Little does he know, Druxy has another plan up her sleeve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Compelling storytelling and characters:</strong></i> The story of DETRA spans four in-game days, with intriguing twists and turns.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Stealth mechanics and difficulty:</strong></i> Switch between first-person and third-person cameras as you avoid glaring security cameras, explore the four different levels and complete your mission to save Druxy.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Atmospheric graphics:</strong></i> Enjoy a dark 3D atmosphere and beautiful 2D graphics.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CONTROLS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The controls can be changed in the game, but these are the defaults.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Movement: WASD</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact: E</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run: Left Shift</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sneak: Ctrl</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Camera Swap: G</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >– </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Default FOV: 90</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Default sens: 2</p>", "short_description": "DETRA is a story-rich supernatural horror game where you follow the story of Vir and Druxy, a scientis